WEBVTT

00:04:30.578 --> 00:04:32.307
Can you build a machine

00:04:32.331 --> 00:04:35.413
that thinks like a human being
that is conscious?

00:04:35.841 --> 00:04:39.171
We sat around and talked about this --
we of course never resolved it.

00:04:39.195 --> 00:04:40.976
But the trouble with the philosophers

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:42.976
is that they were philosophizing

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:45.344
when they should have been
science-ophizing.

00:04:45.788 --> 00:04:48.128
It's a scientific question, after all.

00:04:48.152 --> 00:04:51.059
And this was a very, very
dangerous thing to do

00:04:51.083 --> 00:04:52.512
around Dick Feynman.

00:04:52.536 --> 00:04:54.020
(Laughter)

00:04:55.278 --> 00:04:58.473
Feynman let them have it --
both barrels, right between the eyes.

00:04:58.497 --> 00:05:01.568
It was brutal; it was funny --
ooh, it was funny.